-- Q1810: Review/Compilation Engagements [medium/L2]
-- Issues: #1, #3
UPDATE questions SET
  choices = $EXPL$["In the title of the review report as a qualification indicator","In the management responsibility section of the review report","As a footnote at the bottom of the review report document","In a separate paragraph describing the departure before the conclusion"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under AR-C 90.40, when modifying a review report for a known GAAP departure, the accountant includes a separate paragraph describing the departure and its known or estimated effects. This paragraph is placed before the conclusion paragraph to draw the reader''s attention.
Wrong (A): The report title is not modified to indicate a GAAP departure. The modification appears in a separate paragraph within the body of the report.
Wrong (B): The management responsibility section describes management''s role, not specific departures from the reporting framework.
