-- Q1815: Review/Compilation Engagements [hard/L2]
-- Issues: #1, #3
UPDATE questions SET
  choices = $EXPL$["Accept the revenue figure since management determined the percentage","Recompute all percentage-of-completion calculations independently","Confirm the percentage-of-completion calculations with customers","Inquire of management about revenue growth relative to declining backlog"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under AR-C 90.36, when analytical procedures reveal an inconsistency such as revenue growing while contract backlog declines, the accountant should inquire of management about the discrepancy. Legitimate explanations may include acceleration of existing contracts or changes in estimation methods.
