Wrong (B): Independent recomputation of all calculations is an audit-level procedure beyond the scope of a review engagement under AR-C 90.
Wrong (C): Confirming calculations with external customers is a substantive audit procedure, not an inquiry or analytical procedure appropriate for a review.$EXPL$
