-- Q1845: Attestation Engagements [hard/L2]
-- Issues: #1, #3
UPDATE questions SET
  choices = $EXPL$["Report the factual findings and consider the effect on the engagement","Investigate the fraud thoroughly before reporting any findings","Ignore the fraud since AUP engagements do not involve detection","Issue an opinion on the entity''s overall fraud risk assessment"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under AT-C 215, if the practitioner discovers findings that may indicate fraud during an AUP engagement, the practitioner reports those factual findings as part of the procedures performed and considers the effect on the engagement and any communication obligations.
